            {
              "t": "strong",
              "v": "What LN is doing."
            },
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": " Stock is normally spread over several warehouses, and a warehouse's name does not say what it holds. This view gives one row per warehouse holding or expecting the item, so the warehouse a later walkthrough uses is chosen from its figures. "
            },
            {
              "t": "em",
              "v": "Economic Stock"
            },
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": " on each row is on hand plus on order minus allocated, and goes negative when more is committed than the warehouse has or expects."
            }
          ],
